    "id": "74480",
    "original": "君の実力なら楽勝だとは思うが、それに驕らず、まずはクラスのみんなと切磋琢磨していって欲しい。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "329239",
        "text": "With your ability it should be a doddle, but please don't get too big for your boots: apply yourself diligently like everyone in your class."
      },
